  "2026-10-08T05:29:06.822Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete strict all-status corpus plus the two new boundary findings, exact jscpd 5.4.0 search, and refreshed open/in-progress inventories. No version-specific owner exists. Historical tooling refreshes are complete and remain closed. Registry publication 2026-09-30T18:11:43.825Z exceeds seven days; Node engine >=18 supports the retained project floor. Other newest patch/minor versions remain inside the unchanged cooldown; existing Vitest/TypeScript/npm-package-arg major owners are retained."
  "2026-10-08T05:31:10.835Z","harness:codex","Live dependency disposition: jscpd 5.4.0 is installed without a cooldown override. Current registry confirms CodSpeed 5.7.1 excludes Vitest 5, typescript-estree 8.71.1 excludes TypeScript 7, and npm-package-arg 14 requires Node 22.22.2 / 24.15.0 above the retained 22.18.0 floor; canonical pm-fokyhh, pm-do5b, and pm-ksr40d remain unclaimed. The newest Node types, Greptile, ESLint, TypeScript-ESLint, Knip, marked, Sentry and Unicorn releases are younger than seven days and remain under the unchanged supply-chain cooldown. Pinned pnpm renewal remains separately governed by pm-rnpmtp and its real mixed-runtime admission criteria."
  "2026-10-08T05:32:03.255Z","harness:codex","Pre-close evidence: all selected PM-linked commands passed. Full source coverage passed 788 files and 9910 tests, exact statements 67214/67214, branches 51435/51435, functions 13854/13854, lines 64042/64042. Two Windows-only cases are delegated to the required Windows gate. Documentation, TypeScript and tracked secret gates passed. Hosted review and final aggregate static validation remain delivery checks; no publication of this branch is claimed."
